  },"decision":{"summary":"The board contains two unsupported condition nodes that treat blanks as proof of absence. Evidence confirms the blanks but does not establish whether any alternative documentation or physical verification occurred. The third node is supported because it correctly states a directory cannot confirm valve positions.","evidenceUsed":["eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1","b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],"unknowns":["Whether any physical boundary verification occurred despite blank forms.","What requirement governs the use of a temporary instruction attachment field."],"alternatives":["Crew performed verbal or informal checks not captured in records.","Blank fields reflect administrative delays rather than procedural gaps.,"
